@startuml
!include ../_style.iuml
title Epic 3 — Guidance and re-acquisition

rectangle "Guidance" {
  card US3_1 [
    **US-3.1  Directions follow me as I move**
    As a //user//, I want the directions to update while I walk,
    so that I never have to ask again.
    ----
    * Directions are recomputed on every pose update and pushed to the phone over WebSocket.
    * Words follow the bearing: ahead / slightly left / left / behind.
  ]
  card US3_2 [
    **US-3.2  "Found it!" with the object highlighted**
    As a //user//, I want the object outlined on my screen once it is back in view,
    so that I can spot it immediately.
    ----
    * When the object's 3D position projects inside the current image, Basir searches that region.
    * Detection + SAM produce a mask, confirmed by embedding similarity; IoU > 0.7 on test replays.
    * The mask keeps following the object with SAM video tracking.
  ]
  card US3_3 [
    **US-3.3  Moved objects are noticed**
    As a //user//, I want Basir to tell me when the object is no longer where it was,
    so that I do not keep searching an empty table.
    ----
    * If the spot is in view and the object is not found, the track is marked stale.
    * Basir says "it may have moved" and offers the next candidate.
  ]
}
US3_1 -[hidden]down- US3_2
US3_2 -[hidden]down- US3_3
@enduml
